sequenceDiagram
    title Result Persistence - Record Filled OPEN_TRADE
    autonumber

    participant Recorder as TaskResultRecorder
    participant Ledger as TradeLedger
    participant State as TradeState

    Recorder->>Ledger: record_open(record)
    Ledger->>State: from_open(record)
    State-->>Ledger: mutable open trade state
    Ledger->>Ledger: cache by (task_id, trade_id)
    Note over Recorder,Ledger: Trade summary is emitted later on close or task finish
